  <item>
    <title>16、端午安康！准备好过夏天了吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a374e7175ba9e0c53369134</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a374e7175ba9e0c53369134</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 02:57:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI！各位听众小伙伴，端午安康！希望你度过了一个开心的端午假期😄</span></p><p><span>三天小长假，贝贝哪里也没有去，在空调房躲避夏天的热浪，像小时候无忧无虑的暑假</span></p><p><span>毕竟，在完成了一趟亲子旅行和618购物之后，我终于做好准备过夏天了！</span></p><p><span>今天就和大家分享一下，6月的旅行和攒了一年的好物推荐：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 杭州亲子旅行缘起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 三天两夜杭州行程安排 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 带长辈出游tips</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> beautigo豌豆夹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 炊大皇热油小锅14cm</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 韩国fillimilli电热睫毛夹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> bragg布拉格苹果醋胶囊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 欧丽薇兰特级初榨橄榄油喷雾装200ml</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 隔夜燕麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 山姆app: pan fish生冷冻三文鱼块 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">28:13</a> 山姆app: Member’s Mark 生冷冻大虾仁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 鸡胸肉妙手回春大法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 电饭煲鸡腿肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 无它，买个大蒸锅做鱼虾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 万事利真丝睡衣套装</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a> teenie weenie小熊刺绣真丝A类枕头套纯色单面 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 露露柠檬：夏天推荐swift系列（短袖裤子都超级推荐）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 露露柠檬：秋天推荐scuba卫衣系列</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> Neostrata芯丝翠倍舒5%果酸乳去痘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> bristol 6乳贴（淘宝 bristol6旗舰店是假的！假的！我的购买店铺是Parking LEF） </span></p><p><span> </span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64469a008506e23a39a63b8f/lqZonTbmuEndZQUJ-xhvdFyRmho3.m4a" length="43678421" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:00</itunes:duration>
