  <item>
    <title>12、管她是不是一个人去，那可是巴黎</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe377b01567203211fbcdf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fe377b01567203211fbcdf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 15:14:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi Hi 各位小伙伴们，贝忘录最长的一期节目诞生了，夸我！！</span></p><p><span>夏天夏天悄悄过去，没有见面的日子里，大家还好吗？</span></p><p><span>贝贝度过了难忘的夏天和十一假期，想分享的有很多，今天说说暑假的长途旅游吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 欧洲之行，贝贝为啥选这两个城市啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 时间有限，也容我一分钟吐槽申根签好吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 奥地利作家茨维格和《昨日的世界》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 维也纳初印象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 如果你也只在维也纳市区玩，来参考我的行程吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 维也纳住哪里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 维也纳吃什么...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 维也纳景点推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 如果你也暑假去维也纳，可能会错过...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 维也纳的感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 欧盟境内搭飞机是这样的体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 巴黎公交卡，我建议人手一张</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 巴黎初印象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 规划巴黎行程，贝贝建议说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 巴黎住宿，我想说的有点多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> 巴黎中餐我惊叹一百遍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 购物的浅浅见闻</span></p><p><span>糟糕我忘了讲退税，长话短说就三个字“退现金”，trust me，别挑战欧洲人的靠谱底线，因为他们没有</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 关于卢浮宫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3027">50:27</a> 与维也纳的熟人在巴黎重逢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a> 来来来一起看奥赛博物馆的笑话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3334">55:34</a> 卢浮宫和奥赛买票小tips</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a> 塞纳河游船到底在好玩什么啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3522">58:42</a> 浅浅讲一下其他景点（没什么好说的，去就对了）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3586">59:46</a> 贝贝总结陈词，推荐大家听杨千嬅《自由行》</span></p>]]></description>
