  <item>
    <title>11、穿过头发穿过耳朵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6860fcd508d8fd85868bcc47</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6860fcd508d8fd85868bcc47</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 08:45:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI！贝忘录的听众宝宝们，贝贝勤快地来更新啦——感谢夏天给的能量🙌</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享一下最近爱用和最近的旅行✈️，建议搭配夏夜晚风享用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 我我我夏天的三个关键词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 小家电推荐（Taobao）：蕉下挂脖风扇、图拉斯三合一充电宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 食品类的分享（Taobao）：bragg苹果醋、soacai燕麦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 护肤品类的新探索（cfd会员购小程序）：bioeffect</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 灭螂好物（Xhs）：虫虫战队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a> 武功山徒步季节建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 武功山反穿行程安排</span></p><span></span><p><span>龙山村-羊角尖-发云界-千丈岩-好汉坡-绝望坡-观音宕-吊马桩-金顶或中庵索道下山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 徒步day1：</span></p><span></span><p><span>龙山村-羊角尖-发云界-千丈岩-好汉坡（云中客栈）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 徒步day2&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>好汉坡-绝望坡-观音宕-吊马桩-金顶或中庵索道下山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 喜欢武功山的四个理由 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
