  <item>
    <title>10、都市生活指南之我在深圳考驾照</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67de9fe0dd11f9c8c15e8098</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de9fe0dd11f9c8c15e8098</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 11:37:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见听众老爷们！你们好吗！！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我回来了！！！！！！想死你们了！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>消失的冬天里，贝贝拿下了（十年没拿下）的驾照</span></p><span></span><p><span>厉害死了（先叉会腰）！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为上班族，时间有限，还要和驾校、教练斗智斗勇，真的好辛苦呜呜呜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，为了打破驾考行业的信息不对称，贝贝带着她踩过的坑来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间有限，说的不全面的，欢迎大家评论/私聊我补充～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 感谢催更，请多多鞭策我🥹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 我与驾照的爱恨纠葛，只听干货请跳过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 在深圳考驾照🤔驾校给你的绊子有...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 驾校不会告诉你的事情之约考规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 最节约时间的约考策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 刷够多少学时能报考？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 模拟训练谁在赚钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 按部就班听驾校的安排你会得到...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 教练能帮你的有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 驾校经营不善的原因有🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 怎么让教练帮帮我啊😭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 考前模拟该不该参加？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 关于驾考行业的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 有人能猜到吗</span></p>]]></description>
