  <item>
    <title>9、来三亚当然是冲浪和购物啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670be63bdb2cf82757eb813a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670be63bdb2cf82757eb813a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 15:24:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去三亚之前，贝贝还挺头大，就三天时间，去哪个岛？住哪个酒店？玩哪些项目？逛哪家免税店？优惠券怎么抢啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>玩完之后，贝贝已经是next level！</span></p><span></span><p><span>结论是，玩得还不错，三亚懒人三日游全攻略在这，你们不用烦了，直接无脑抄吧😎</span></p><span></span><p><span>先上 p 人装 j 之列行程excel🥰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxDw0tUdVdU4iDckSQpSDvfxVwb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 三亚政府购物优惠券怎么抢啊啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 万宁住宿推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 必看！不看脱你一层皮的防晒小tips！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 噔噔噔噔——真.实.冲浪运动大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 浮潜到底需要带点啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 浮潜是咋个事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 完蛋这里嘴瓢了应该是“三亚”有四座免税城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> CDF国际免税城买点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> 海旅免税城再买点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 国药中服免税城又买点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 机场免税店还能买点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 购物经验大公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a> 答应我买延误险好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 旅行祝福，嘻嘻</span></p>]]></description>
