  <item>
    <title>7、遇见新疆，在云海无法翻越的高度</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6623bffdc3e09d8f375295db</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6623bffdc3e09d8f375295db</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Apr 2024 13:15:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于，终于又轮到我（长途）旅游啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>清明8天小假期，贝贝去了心心念念的</span><strong><span>新疆</span></strong><span>，</span></p><span></span><p><span>单程飞行8小时的</span><strong><span>帕米尔高原</span></strong><span>之旅，</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪山、湖泊、杏花、异域风情，遥远的丝绸之路，神奇的大美新疆！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiqoInjHIMYHcaAHchhm9oNJ-pD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> </span><strong><span>天山</span></strong><span>你好，在一万米的高空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 莎车：叶尔羌汉王宫和</span><strong><span>阿曼尼沙汗</span></strong><span>纪念陵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 喀什：小逛</span><strong><span>汗巴扎</span></strong><span>，随处鸽子汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 阿克陶县：前方</span><strong><span>白沙湖</span></strong><span>，美女请保持理智！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 阿克陶县：</span><strong><span>木吉火山口</span></strong><span>，3块钱的可乐感天动地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 高原温馨小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 塔县：</span><strong><span>慕士塔格峰</span></strong><span>，词穷，我又又又哭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> 塔县：塔什库尔干、塔吉克族、</span><strong><span>石头城</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">38:18</a> 塔县：吃不饱饭，我轻轻地崩溃了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 塔县：爱我的朋友们！永远爱和女孩子们的旅行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> 塔县：古道、杏花，这里是毒妇也会从良的桃花源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 喀什：没玩够，下次还来</span></p>]]></description>
